# Reference material dropped in assets/ref while designing is kept out of the
# repo unless the game or a lab page actually loads it. The D-Rex reference
# stills ARE committed (drex-lab.html displays them); scratch audio is not —
# a single uncompressed take runs to tens of megabytes and would live in the
# history forever for no benefit.
assets/ref/*.wav
assets/ref/*.aif
assets/ref/*.aiff
assets/ref/*.mp4
assets/ref/*.mov
